# The old text is literal (a `\n` in it is a line feed) and must be in the file exactly once; the gate is run with the
# edited serializer and must fail with the heading the letter names: F, UNEXPLAINED FAILURES (a serializer vector);
# T, UNEXPLAINED ROUND TRIPS (a tree vector that no longer reads back as the standard allows); S, STALE EXCEPTIONS (a
# vector the serializer was listed as failing now passes). A plant that no gate sees is a rule nothing holds.
